1
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:08,880
Accounts lists every client account: balance, equity, margin, profit, default amount and negotiation mode.

2
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:13,600
The DEALER row at the top is your own side of all client positions.

3
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:19,240
Search by account, trader or name.

4
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:25,360
Select an account and the Summary below shows only its positions, by instrument.

5
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:31,220
Right-click an account for everything you can do with it: negotiation, default amount, group, dealer range, deactivate, reports, messages and export.

6
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:35,430
Show in Trader Details opens the trader's accounts, positions and orders.

7
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:43,270
Everything for this trader in one window.

8
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:47,990
Closed Positions shows the account's closed trades in Position History.

9
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:56,160
The title shows the account. Show All Accounts goes back to everyone.

10
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:58,670
Clear the search to see all accounts again.

